Third-party components (fetched or linked at build/runtime, not vendored here):

  * TensorFlow Lite (NXP i.MX fork, https://github.com/nxp-imx/tensorflow-imx)
    Apache License 2.0. Fetched at CMake configure time and statically linked.

  * libsystemd (sd-event / sd-bus), https://github.com/systemd/systemd
    LGPL-2.1-or-later. Linked dynamically; provided by the target OS at runtime.

  * Vivante VX external delegate (libvx_delegate.so)
    Provided by the NXP BSP on the target device; loaded at runtime for NPU
    acceleration. Not distributed with this project.
